is following this spirit I designed <strong>You Are The Bomb: A Game About\u00a0Rolling Bombs</strong>. If you decide to purchase a copy, I  thank you for supporting this project and I hope that you'll enjoy this challenging game. Remember ... should you find yourself frustrated, never give up! The clock is ticking, and the world is waiting for its hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let\u2019s roll into this journey together! \ud83d\udca3</p>",
